# ── Secrets & local runtime state ────────────────────────────────────────────
# server/.env holds the JWT signing key, the admin password and (once you
# deploy) the database URL and Supabase service key. Those must never reach a
# remote. Templates stay tracked.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Runtime image uploads when STORAGE_MODE is local.
uploads/

